      "metadata": {
        "id": "e3efb5fa"
      },
      "source": [
        "The 1% take home, on average, about £2,000 a week. How does that compare with the 90th percentile? We can access a **row** with `.loc[row label]`; because our index is the percentile, we can just read it off:"
      ]
    },
